---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import SectionBody from "./SectionBody.astro";
import SectionContent from "./SectionContent.astro";
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
---

<div class="max-w-320 w-full mt-48 flex flex-col items-center gap-24 px-6">
  <Section>
    <SectionContent>
      <SectionHeading>Express your thoughts.</SectionHeading>
      <SectionBody>
        A powerful editor to satisfy a variety of use cases, from to-do lists to
        documentation.<br />
        Stay organized with documents that match your vibe.
      </SectionBody>
    </SectionContent>
    <img src="/section1.webp" />
  </Section>
  <Section>
    <SectionContent class="md:order-1">
      <SectionHeading>Customization, redefined.</SectionHeading>
      <SectionBody>
        Some notes deserve a unique color - and you deserve a workspace that
        reflects you.
        <br />
        Darkwrite is designed to be yours - from the colors to the fonts of your
        choice.
      </SectionBody>
    </SectionContent>
    <img class="md:-order-1" src="/section2.webp" />
  </Section>
  <Section>
    <SectionContent>
      <SectionHeading>Works offline.</SectionHeading>
      <SectionBody>
        Darkwrite keeps everything on your device - available to you at all
        times. You own your data.
        <br />
        You are never dependent on a network connection or cloud service.
      </SectionBody>
    </SectionContent>
    <img src="/section3.svg" />
  </Section>
</div>
